Subject: [PATCH] feat(stripe): RAK-first Checkout, retainers, and billing mesh
 controls

Pin stripe@23 / 2026-09-30.endive, prefer restricted keys, omit
payment_method_types, set integration_identifier, and fulfill from
async-safe webhooks. Add a $8000/mo GitOps retainer subscription,
Customer Portal, AES-256-GCM PII sealing, audit/metrics/readiness,
intrusion windows, and an async DAG that emits PipeFish A2A envelopes.
