+# GitOps / AgentOps Retainer
+
+## What I Need
+
+- Organization or control-plane scope
+- Priority incident contacts
+- Repos, catalogs, and workflows in scope
+- Current on-call or operator constraints
+
+## Deliverables
+
+- Monthly operations report
+- Priority incident response within the purchased SLA
+- Catalog and workflow upkeep
+- Agent routing and secret-hygiene review notes
+
+## Operator Checklist
+
+- Confirm this is a subscription retainer, not a one-time Moltgate ping
+- Keep card data on Stripe Checkout / Customer Portal
+- Do not enable Stripe Tax until a Collecting registration exists
+- Route self-serve cancel / payment-method changes through the Customer Portal
